---@field CodeDeliveryDetails? aws.cognito_identity_provider.CodeDeliveryDetailsType In user pools that automatically verify and confirm new users, Amazon Cognito sends users a message with a code or link that confirms ownership of the phone number or email address that they entered. The CodeDeliveryDetails object is information about the delivery destination for that link or code.
---@field UserSub aws.cognito_identity_provider.StringType The unique identifier of the new user, for example a1b2c3d4-5678-90ab-cdef-EXAMPLE11111.
---@field Session? distilled.Secret A session Id that you can pass to ConfirmSignUp when you want to immediately sign in your user with the USER_AUTH flow after they complete sign-up.

